{"product_id":"the-lost-plot","title":"The Lost Plot","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn a 1920s-esque America, Prohibition is in force, fedoras, flapper dresses, and tommy guns are in fashion, and intrigue is afoot. Intrepid Librarians Irene and Kai find themselves caught in the middle of a dragon vs dragon contest. It seems a young librarian has become tangled in this conflict, and if they can't extricate him there could be serious political repercussions for the mysterious Library. And, as the balance of power across mighty factions hangs in the balance, this could even trigger war. Irene and Kai find themselves trapped in a race against time (and dragons) to procure a rare book. They'll face gangsters, blackmail, and fiendish security systems. And if this doesn't end well, it could have dire consequences for Irene's job. And, incidentally, for her life.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Genevieve Cogman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781509830701\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 341\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45872026353817,"sku":"13RA9781509830701","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f464fbb7cd_The_Lost_Plot.jpg?v=1762614462","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-lost-plot","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}